-- One-time data update: Greenland Expedition gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout and opening (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts):
-- until now it was physically the same track as Åre Run. A snowdrift start past
-- the sled dogs (the field let go in waves), over the sastrugi, a sweep down
-- the glacier, the hairpin past the musk ox, over the crevasse bridge, down
-- through the ice cave (the big feature and new signature: a long steep drop
-- inside the glacier), S-bends and a spiral along the fjord and the run to
-- Ilulissat's harbour. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its track
-- record, country records and players' personal bests start again from now
-- (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Greenland Expedition track row changes.

